        steal=['Make a small ratio test sheet: 1:1, 3:2, 4:3, 60:40 and phi, each with the real headline, image and action.', 'Use phi or Fibonacci values as a token family only when the jumps improve hierarchy; do not force every gap to belong to it.', 'Hide the overlay before approval. If the crop, logo or page only looks right with the spiral visible, the tool has become a crutch.'],
        director='A proportional system can make a production design feel like one world: repeated door heights, table widths, frame crops and actor-to-set relationships. The director still chooses when a character, prop or cut violates that order.',
